ff52072><!--[--><p>Prospective clients can get in touch with our sales and onboarding team via our <a href="https://clearstreet.io/contact" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-component="hyperlink" aria-label="Link" data-disabled="false" title="https://clearstreet.io/contact" data-v-223f919b><!--[-->Contact page.<!--]--></a> A representative will reach out to discuss your execution, financing and clearing needs.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><div data-component="single-faq" class="" data-v-688aecbd data-v-3ff52072><div class="header" data-v-3ff52072><p class="-body_medium_regular" data-v-3ff52072>What makes Clear Street different?</p><div class="icons" data-v-3ff52072><div data-component="icon" class="xlarge plus" data-v-3ff52072 data-v-0b1d9552><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-0b1d9552><g clip-path="url(#clip0_1926_2354)"><path d="M20.75 11.25H12.75V3.25H11.25V11.25H3.25V12.75H11.25V20.75H12.75V12.75H20.75V11.25Z" fill="black"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_1926_2354"><rect width="17.5" height="17.5" fill="white" transform="translate(3.25 3.25)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div><div data-component="icon" class="xlarge minus" data-v-3ff52072 data-v-0b1d9552><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-0b1d9552><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M20.75 12.75L3.25 12.75L3.25 11.25L20.75 11.25L20.75 12.75Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="content -body_medium_regular" data-v-3ff52072><div class="inner" data-v-3ff52072><!--[--><p>Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.</p><p>
We give our clients the technology, tools and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><div data-component="single-faq" class="" data-v-688aecbd data-v-3ff52072><div class="header" data-v-3ff52072><p class="-body_medium_regular" data-v-3ff52072>Can you accommodate derivatives-based ETFs (levered, inverse, options overlays)?</p><div class="icons" data-v-3ff52072><div data-component="icon" class="xlarge plus" data-v-3ff52072 data-v-0b1d9552><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-0b1d9552><g clip-path="url(#clip0_1926_2354)"><path d="M20.75 11.25H12.75V3.25H11.25V11.25H3.25V12.75H11.25V20.75H12.75V12.75H20.75V11.25Z" fill="black"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_1926_2354"><rect width="17.5" height="17.5" fill="white" transform="translate(3.25 3.25)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div><div data-component="icon" class="xlarge minus" data-v-3ff52072 data-v-0b1d9552><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-0b1d9552><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M20.75 12.75L3.25 12.75L3.25 11.25L20.75 11.25L20.75 12.75Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="content -body_medium_regular" data-v-3ff52072><div class="inner" data-v-3ff52072><!--[--><p>Yes. Our derivatives stack (listed options/futures and security-based swaps) operates alongside cash on the same platform, with unified risk and margin.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><div data-component="single-faq" class="" data-v-688aecbd data-v-3ff52072><div class="header" data-v-3ff52072><p class="-body_medium_regular" data-v-3ff52072>How does Clear Street facilitate my ETF strategy?</p><div class="icons" data-v-3ff52072><div data-component="icon" class="xlarge plus" data-v-3ff52072 data-v-0b1d9552><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-0b1d9552><g clip-path="url(#clip0_1926_2354)"><path d="M20.75 11.25H12.75V3.25H11.25V11.25H3.25V12.75H11.25V20.75H12.75V12.75H20.75V11.25Z" fill="black"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_1926_2354"><rect width="17.5" height="17.5" fill="white" transform="translate(3.25 3.25)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div><div data-component="icon" class="xlarge minus" data-v-3ff52072 data-v-0b1d9552><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-0b1d9552><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M20.75 12.75L3.25 12.75L3.25 11.25L20.75 11.25L20.75 12.75Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="content -body_medium_regular" data-v-3ff52072><div class="inner" data-v-3ff52072><!--[--><p>Whether absolute return, hedge or risk-adjusted, Clear Street assembles the right contracts, trades and workflows to bring your strategy to life. This spans a variety of both execution methods – spanning low-touch, high-touch, algo and outsourced trading – and products and asset classes, including options, futures and swaps.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><section data-component="get-in-touch" class="midnight" data-v-d8f56d83 data-v-bb47104a><div class="bg-media-container" data-v-bb47104a><img onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Get in Touch Image" data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 400px, (max-width: 1699px) 800px, 1700px" srcset="/_ipx/w_400&amp;f_webp/imgs/misc/get-in-touch-dark.jpg 400w, /_ipx/w_800&amp;f_webp/imgs/misc/get-in-touch-dark.jpg 800w, /_ipx/w_1600&amp;f_webp/imgs/misc/get-in-touch-dark.jpg 1600w, /_ipx/w_1700&amp;f_webp/imgs/misc/get-in-touch-dark.jpg 1700w, /_ipx/w_3400&amp;f_webp/imgs/misc/get-in-touch-dark.jpg 3400w" class="mobile" title="Get in Touch Image" src="/_ipx/w_3400&amp;f_webp/imgs/misc/get-in-touch-dark.jpg" data-v-bb47104a><img class="desktop" src="/imgs/misc/get-in-touch-dark.jpg" title="Get in Touch Image" alt="Get in Touch Image" data-v-bb47104a></div><div class="row align-center align-middle content-container" data-v-bb47104a><div class="xxlarge-12 small-22 xsmall-32 col" data-v-bb47104a><div class="inner" data-v-bb47104a><span class="bg" data-v-bb47104a></span><div class="title-container" data-v-bb47104a><h3 class="-h5 title" data-v-bb47104a>Get in touch with our team</h3></div><div class="contact-container" data-v-bb47104a><a href="/contact" class="blueberry primary medium back cta-btn" data-component="button" aria-label="Contact us" data-disabled="false" title="Contact us" data-hover="false" data-v-bb47104a data-v-fdc95d51 data-v-223f919b><!--[--><span class="bg" data-v-fdc95d51></span><!----><span class="-body label" data-v-fdc95d51>Contact us</span><!--]--></a></div></div></div></div></section><footer data-component="footer" class="dark" data-section-intersect="dark" data-v-d8f56d83 data-v-102fcbd7><div class="row main-footer" data-v-102fcbd7><span class="bg" data-v-102fcbd7></span><div class="xxlarge-5 small-32 col left-col" data-v-102fcbd7><div class="top" data-v-102fcbd7><p class="-body col-title" data-v-102fcbd7>Get Started</p><a href="https://app.clearstreet.io/public/auth/login" rel="external nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-component="button" aria-label="Login" data-disabled="false" title="Login" data-hover="false" class="dark primary small back btn" data-v-102fcbd7 data-v-fdc95d51 data-v-223f919b><!--[--><span class="bg" data-v-fdc95d51></span><!----><span class="-body label" data-v-fdc95d51>Login</span><!--]--></a></div><div class="bottom" data-v-102fcbd7><ul class="list" data-v-102fcbd7><!--[--><li class="item" data-v-102fcbd7><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/clear-street" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-component="hyperlink" aria-label="Link" data-disabled="false" title="https://www.linkedi